<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND SECOND STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND SECOND STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
